  "details": "So.. we can toggle some features in instances now... how about being able to also toggle: Avatar Sounds, Camera, Seats and Particles.\n\nCamera especially would be useful in some games to prevent people from cheating/looking around corners, essentially an extension to toggling Drones.\n\nThe other three are just... you cut down on avatar spam, griefing and other annoyances.\n\nThis would also help moderating.",
